BUILD 88 - Supra crafting laws

- Every craftable supra (Mythic Formula) recipe now requires at least one reagent that
  only drops in Legendary, so no supra can be finished without farming Legendary.
- No two supra recipes ask for the same reagents any more. Five duplicate recipe groups
  (a six-way axe group, a mace group and three pairs) now each have distinct requirements.
- Supra items no longer drop below Legendary. The four supra thrown weapons (Charon's
  Toll, Hati, Sanguine Orbit, The Last Word) that used to appear in Epic loot now drop
  only on Legendary, where they remain droppable.
- Formula label fix: Hati's recipe now reads Mythic Formula - Hati (was Arcane Formula).

Database plus a one-line text update. No map or quest change; existing characters and
saves are unaffected. Fully quit and restart Steam to pick up the update.
